DeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-1-0-H-0-0-0", "desc": "微信读书·学生勋章", "title": "学生认证", "levelIndex": 1}}}}]}, {"range": "8234-8261", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "237554720_8a2UpXjpY", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 12, "content": "在长波理论里，投资品（Capital Goods）指：为了未来生产而购买的资产，而不是立即消费掉的东西。\n包括：设备、机床、工业机器人、发电机、厂房、工厂、仓库、基础设施、铁路、港口、电网、建筑物、商业地产、工业园区、运输工具、船舶、飞机、软件、研发（现代意义）\n\n半投资品（Intermediate Producer Goods）是产业分类概念\n包括：钢铁钢材，石化制品 如塑料，化纤，铜，铝\n\n资源 - 半投资品（钢铁、石化）- 投资品（机床、厂房）- 消费品（汽车、家电）- 消费者", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "在长波的上升期，投资品的生产比消费品的生产扩张得更快。", "range": "8234-8261", "chapterName": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "chapterIdx": 12, "reviewId": "237554720_8a2UpXjpY", "userVid": 237554720, "topics": [], "createTime": 1782102278, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "author": {"userVid": 237554720, "name": "Flaaaaaaaaash", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-NhbHkFzMelK60ty1tUcTH10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "So it goes", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "永远真实 保持热爱", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-1000", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "55187530_8a9rSWLcT", "review": {"abstract": "长波的上升期，投资品的生产比消费品的生产扩张得更快。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "chapterUid": 12, "content": "感觉现在AI就是这样，是要到上升期了吗？", "contextAbstrac