旧体系，产业转型，格局动荡，阶层流动加快。下降阶段，大家预期慢慢降低，社会反而沉闷保守", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "9110-9196", "createTime": 1791334325, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 12, "reviewId": "407149178_8cFrBVpxm", "userVid": 407149178, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "author": {"userVid": 407149178, "name": "萧瑟", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/rhHNtG0mghT70wG4dTaszRB5cQnU9K7s0icdBYSjmhicia1mxOQlhaKMVDibsWksQd2rgbMUZUCH7nCJofMj8WxDyHzkvmcaGxnxmyQ45T9fcpg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "mathematics", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20260831-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "282892689_89pyL2ngl", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 12, "content": "上升波开始之前和之后，社会经济生活经历了相当大的变化\n—— 康波从萧条转入回升/繁荣期，往往伴随重大技术革命、制度变革或战争等“破坏性创造”，改变生产方式、能源结构、社会组织。\n\n与下降波相比，上升波期间伴随着更多的社会动乱和激烈的变化\n—— 这个结论可能反直觉（通常认为衰退期才乱）。但康波观察到：上升期（繁荣）会加剧贫富分化、阶级矛盾、殖民扩张、战争风险等。因为新技术催生新富，旧产业没落，社会结构剧烈重组。\n\n下降波期间伴随着较长和较严重的农业衰退\n—— 农业是基础产业。长波下降期（尤其是萧条阶段），大宗商品（农产品）价格长期低迷，农民收入锐减，土地抛荒，农业危机加深。这是实体经济疲弱的典型信号。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "(1)在上升波开始之后和之前，社会经济生活经历了相当大的变化；(2)与下降波相比，上升波期间伴随着更多的社会动乱和激烈的变化；(3)下降波期间伴随着较长和较严重的农业衰退", "range": "9110-9195", "chapterName": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "chapterIdx": 12, "reviewId": "282892689_89pyL2ngl", "userVid": 282892689, "topics": [], "createTime": 1779867225, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "author": {"userVid": 282892689, "name": "施宇峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKS3YoCdhDRwKYIVhkXc2BKCa4ZibG5prZpdkoW5V5My8UcKmjbTSQ1ja6gy7SN9PqiaCwODqLgrNdg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, "likesCount": 8}, {"reviewId": "380402079_80OXJgcEg", "review": {"abstract": "在上升波开始之后和之前，社会经济生活经历了相当大的变化；(2)与下降波相比，上升波期间伴随着更多的社会动乱和激烈的变化；(3)下降波期间伴随着较长和较严重的农业衰退", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "chapterUid": 12, "content": "长波上升期和末期，社会经济会繁荣，但是上升期有更多的社会动荡和激烈？我猜想是因为由于打破了以前的不平衡，所以，某些环节会失衡引起的。长波的衰退期和复苏期，相对社会还是比较稳定，因为出现了平衡期，所以常波才会衰退，这时候，会伴随着农业的下降？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "9113-9195", "createTime": 1749615577, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80OXJgcEg", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 12, "chapterTitle": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravat